 # Changelog
 
+## [v0.1.42-test.1] - 2026-11-27
+
+> R55 strict CSM TLV parsing for 0x4301 and 0x5703 endpoint data. This is parser hardening, not evidence of a vehicle connection fix.
+
+### English
+- Add a strict CSM TLV parser that rejects truncated headers, invalid lengths and truncated values instead of silently discarding malformed trailing bytes; preserve the existing permissive parser for unrelated compatibility paths.
+- Use strict parsing for 0x4301 and nested wireless endpoint data, and for 0x5703 Wi-Fi credentials.
+- Reject duplicate critical endpoint fields (wireless group, port, device identifier, public key, source version; SSID, passphrase, security type and channel). Preserve repeated wireless parameter 3 address entries used by existing fixtures.
+- Refuse malformed 0x4301 endpoint handoff; ignore malformed late 0x4301 updates without invoking the endpoint callback.
+- Replace raw 0x4301 hex dumps and wireless-value hex logs with ID/length-only summaries; fingerprint device identifiers and public keys so SSIDs, Wi-Fi passwords and raw identity values do not enter diagnostic logs.
+- Add regression tests for 1–3 byte trailing fragments, invalid/overrun lengths, duplicate critical fields, repeated address fields, malformed nested wireless groups, late endpoint handoff and credential-log redaction.
+- Focused exact-source parser tests and fuzz checks are recorded separately. Full Android Gradle build, APK packaging and real-vehicle behavior remain unverified.
+
+### 简体中文
+- 新增严格 CSM TLV 解析器：遇到不完整头部、非法长度或值越界时拒绝整组参数，不再静默丢弃尾部异常字节；旧宽松解析器保留给未迁移的兼容路径。
+- `0x4301` 及其嵌套无线端点参数、`0x5703` Wi-Fi 凭据改用严格解析。
+- 拒绝关键端点字段重复（无线组、端口、设备标识、公钥、版本；SSID、密码、安全类型、信道）；保留现有协议夹具中允许重复的无线参数 3 地址字段。
+- 畸形 `0x4301` 不得交付端点；保活期间晚到的畸形 `0x4301` 直接忽略，不触发端点更新回调。
+- 删除 `0x4301` 原始十六进制转储及无线组字段值日志，改为只记录参数 ID/长度；设备标识和公钥改为指纹，避免 SSID、Wi-Fi 密码及原始身份值进入诊断日志。
+- 新增尾部 1～3 字节、非法/越界长度、关键字段重复、重复地址字段、嵌套无线组异常、晚到端点交付及凭据日志脱敏回归测试。
+- 精确源码解析器测试及模糊输入结果另行记录。完整 Android Gradle 编译、APK 打包及实车行为仍未验证。
+
+Full changes / 完整变更: [v0.1.41-test.1...v0.1.42-test.1](https://github.com/1092679281/Android-/compare/v0.1.41-test.1...v0.1.42-test.1)
+
